{"id":"forecast-04","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-04/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":516.31,"segments":[{"start":0.24,"end":7.78,"text":"Section 3. You will hear a student called Joel talking to his tutor about his research","words":[["Section",0.24,0.86],["3.",0.86,1.44],["You",2.3,2.88],["will",2.88,3.04],["hear",3.04,3.22],["a",3.22,3.36],["student",3.36,3.72],["called",3.72,4.3],["Joel",4.3,4.68],["talking",4.68,5.58],["to",5.58,5.82],["his",5.82,6.04],["tutor",6.04,6.38],["about",6.38,7.02],["his",7.02,7.32],["research",7.32,7.78]]},{"start":7.78,"end":11.92,"text":"into farmers attitudes towards new developments in agriculture.","words":[["into",7.78,8.18],["farmers",8.18,8.6],["attitudes",8.6,9.2],["towards",9.2,9.96],["new",9.96,10.34],["developments",10.34,10.96],["in",10.96,11.38],["agriculture.",11.38,11.92]]},{"start":13.4,"end":67.26,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 26 on page 5. Now listen carefully and","words":[["First,",13.4,14.04],["you",14.48,14.6],["have",14.6,14.8],["some",14.8,15.0],["time",15.0,15.38],["to",15.38,15.62],["look",15.62,15.74],["at",15.74,15.9],["questions",15.9,16.32],["21",16.32,17.34],["to",17.34,17.78],["26",17.78,18.4],["on",18.4,19.18],["page",19.18,19.44],["5.",19.44,19.96],["Now",65.66,65.98],["listen",65.98,66.26],["carefully",66.26,66.72],["and",66.72,67.26]]},{"start":67.26,"end":70.1,"text":"answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["answer",67.26,67.52],["questions",67.52,67.98],["21",67.98,68.98],["to",68.98,69.46],["26.",69.46,70.1]]},{"start":70.1,"end":74.45,"text":"Dr Owen?","words":[["Dr",70.1,71.36],["Owen?",74.11,74.45]]},{"start":75.17,"end":79.05,"text":"Come in Joel. Right, so how's your research going?","words":[["Come",75.17,75.41],["in",75.41,75.67],["Joel.",75.67,75.97],["Right,",76.65,76.93],["so",77.19,77.49],["how's",77.49,77.91],["your",77.91,78.07],["research",78.07,78.53],["going?",78.53,79.05]]},{"start":79.63,"end":84.91,"text":"You're looking at how farmers feel about new technology in agriculture aren't you?","words":[["You're",79.63,80.01],["looking",80.01,80.27],["at",80.27,80.55],["how",80.55,80.89],["farmers",80.89,81.33],["feel",81.33,81.69],["about",81.69,81.93],["new",81.93,82.49],["technology",82.49,83.17],["in",83.17,83.51],["agriculture",83.51,84.11],["aren't",84.11,84.71],["you?",84.71,84.91]]},{"start":85.45,"end":88.55,"text":"Well actually it's more general than that.","words":[["Well",85.45,85.77],["actually",85.77,86.51],["it's",86.51,87.21],["more",87.21,87.43],["general",87.43,87.83],["than",87.83,88.23],["that.",88.23,88.55]]},{"start":89.11,"end":93.55,"text":"I'm looking at their attitudes to a variety of new developments in agriculture.","words":[["I'm",89.11,89.67],["looking",89.67,89.87],["at",89.87,90.07],["their",90.07,90.19],["attitudes",90.19,90.71],["to",90.71,91.05],["a",91.05,91.19],["variety",91.19,91.55],["of",91.55,91.99],["new",91.99,92.19],["developments",92.19,92.63],["in",92.63,93.05],["agriculture.",93.05,93.55]]},{"start":94.01,"end":97.71,"text":"Okay. Have you got a title for the project yet?","words":[["Okay.",94.01,94.41],["Have",95.01,95.31],["you",95.31,95.49],["got",95.49,95.77],["a",95.77,95.99],["title",95.99,96.45],["for",96.45,96.81],["the",96.81,96.91],["project",96.91,97.39],["yet?",97.39,97.71]]},{"start":98.31,"end":100.53,"text":"I was thinking of something simple.","words":[["I",98.31,98.79],["was",98.79,98.91],["thinking",98.91,99.23],["of",99.23,99.55],["something",99.55,100.07],["simple.",100.07,100.53]]},{"start":100.53,"end":105.85,"text":"Like, farmers' attitudes towards the adoption of new farming practices.","words":[["Like,",100.53,101.21],["farmers'",101.79,102.37],["attitudes",102.61,103.05],["towards",103.05,103.49],["the",103.49,103.77],["adoption",103.77,104.19],["of",104.19,104.65],["new",104.65,104.93],["farming",104.93,105.29],["practices.",105.29,105.85]]},{"start":106.65,"end":109.27,"text":"That's possibly a bit too general.","words":[["That's",106.65,107.25],["possibly",107.25,107.85],["a",107.85,108.01],["bit",108.01,108.13],["too",108.13,108.69],["general.",108.69,109.27]]},{"start":110.01,"end":113.01,"text":"I think the title needs to be a bit more specific.","words":[["I",110.01,110.27],["think",110.27,110.41],["the",110.41,110.53],["title",110.53,110.89],["needs",110.89,111.25],["to",111.25,111.49],["be",111.49,111.65],["a",111.65,111.77],["bit",111.77,112.09],["more",112.09,112.27],["specific.",112.27,113.01]]},{"start":114.07,"end":116.61,"text":"What kind of farming will you be looking at?","words":[["What",114.07,114.23],["kind",114.23,114.67],["of",114.67,114.83],["farming",114.83,115.27],["will",115.27,115.77],["you",115.77,115.91],["be",115.91,116.05],["looking",116.05,116.25],["at?",116.25,116.61]]},{"start":117.21,"end":119.01,"text":"Well, that'll vary actually.","words":[["Well,",117.21,117.57],["that'll",117.85,118.25],["vary",118.25,118.61],["actually.",118.61,119.01]]},{"start":120.11,"end":123.27,"text":"But I want to speak to each of the ten farmers in my sample.","words":[["But",120.11,120.31],["I",120.31,120.45],["want",120.45,120.57],["to",120.57,120.73],["speak",120.73,120.93],["to",120.93,121.17],["each",121.17,121.43],["of",121.43,121.61],["the",121.61,121.75],["ten",121.75,121.99],["farmers",121.99,122.41],["in",122.41,122.65],["my",122.65,122.83],["sample.",122.83,123.27]]},{"start":123.85,"end":126.87,"text":"So I've chosen farms which are all in the same region.","words":[["So",123.85,124.23],["I've",124.23,124.47],["chosen",124.47,124.77],["farms",124.77,125.17],["which",125.17,125.45],["are",125.45,125.67],["all",125.67,126.03],["in",126.03,126.17],["the",126.17,126.29],["same",126.29,126.55],["region.",126.55,126.87]]},{"start":126.87,"end":131.97,"text":"OK. Well, I'd specify where they are, then.","words":[["OK.",126.87,127.75],["Well,",128.41,128.79],["I'd",129.01,129.49],["specify",129.49,129.97],["where",129.97,131.01],["they",131.01,131.45],["are,",131.45,131.77],["then.",131.85,131.97]]},{"start":132.55,"end":135.47,"text":"Right. I'll amend the title to do that.","words":[["Right.",132.55,132.99],["I'll",133.31,133.73],["amend",133.73,134.23],["the",134.23,134.49],["title",134.49,134.81],["to",134.81,135.11],["do",135.11,135.27],["that.",135.27,135.47]]},{"start":135.77,"end":141.69,"text":"OK. Is there any particular reason why you've decided to do face-to-face interviews?","words":[["OK.",135.77,136.07],["Is",136.77,137.03],["there",137.03,137.27],["any",137.27,137.55],["particular",137.55,137.99],["reason",137.99,138.47],["why",138.47,138.91],["you've",138.91,139.15],["decided",139.15,139.55],["to",139.55,139.87],["do",139.87,140.09],["face",140.09,140.65],["-to",140.65,140.91],["-face",140.91,141.11],["interviews?",141.11,141.69]]},{"start":142.57,"end":145.11,"text":"It'll be quite time-consuming, won't it?","words":[["It'll",142.57,142.91],["be",142.91,143.05],["quite",143.05,143.33],["time",143.33,143.91],["-consuming,",143.91,144.57],["won't",144.57,144.95],["it?",144.95,145.11]]},{"start":145.49,"end":150.79,"text":"Yes. And I did consider doing telephone interviews for that reason.","words":[["Yes.",145.49,146.21],["And",146.63,147.09],["I",147.09,147.45],["did",147.45,147.61],["consider",147.61,148.07],["doing",148.07,148.49],["telephone",148.49,148.97],["interviews",148.97,149.69],["for",149.69,150.23],["that",150.23,150.41],["reason.",150.41,150.79]]},{"start":151.75,"end":156.15,"text":"Especially as it's unnecessary for me to actually see the places where they work.","words":[["Especially",151.75,152.13],["as",152.13,152.47],["it's",152.47,152.73],["unnecessary",152.73,153.09],["for",153.09,153.63],["me",153.63,153.77],["to",153.77,153.93],["actually",153.93,154.27],["see",154.27,154.65],["the",154.65,154.89],["places",154.89,155.29],["where",155.29,155.65],["they",155.65,155.81],["work.",155.81,156.15]]},{"start":156.15,"end":162.21,"text":"It's just that, in my experience, a lot of farmers don't like talking on the phone,","words":[["It's",156.15,157.37],["just",157.37,157.57],["that,",157.57,157.81],["in",157.89,158.57],["my",158.57,158.77],["experience,",158.77,159.33],["a",159.59,159.73],["lot",159.73,159.81],["of",159.81,159.99],["farmers",159.99,160.35],["don't",160.35,160.85],["like",160.85,161.09],["talking",161.09,161.43],["on",161.43,161.71],["the",161.71,161.83],["phone,",161.83,162.21]]},{"start":162.73,"end":166.53,"text":"so they'll be more likely to talk freely if I see them in person.","words":[["so",162.73,163.09],["they'll",163.09,163.31],["be",163.31,163.43],["more",163.43,163.61],["likely",163.61,163.83],["to",163.83,164.05],["talk",164.05,164.31],["freely",164.31,164.79],["if",164.79,165.31],["I",165.31,165.53],["see",165.53,165.91],["them",165.91,166.05],["in",166.05,166.19],["person.",166.19,166.53]]},{"start":167.09,"end":171.05,"text":"Yes, you're probably right. Good.","words":[["Yes,",167.09,167.43],["you're",167.99,168.39],["probably",168.39,168.95],["right.",168.95,169.49],["Good.",170.55,171.05]]},{"start":171.71,"end":177.93,"text":"Then the first thing I want to investigate is how the farmers actually find out about","words":[["Then",171.71,171.97],["the",171.97,172.59],["first",172.59,172.87],["thing",172.87,173.21],["I",173.21,173.61],["want",173.61,173.79],["to",173.79,173.93],["investigate",173.93,174.45],["is",174.45,174.89],["how",174.89,175.67],["the",175.67,175.83],["farmers",175.83,176.15],["actually",176.15,176.77],["find",176.77,177.21],["out",177.21,177.63],["about",177.63,177.93]]},{"start":177.93,"end":183.83,"text":"new developments in agriculture that they might want to adopt. What sources they use.","words":[["new",177.93,178.25],["developments",178.25,178.73],["in",178.73,179.03],["agriculture",179.03,179.59],["that",179.59,180.17],["they",180.17,180.35],["might",180.35,180.59],["want",180.59,180.89],["to",180.89,181.09],["adopt.",181.09,181.57],["What",182.21,182.73],["sources",182.73,183.19],["they",183.19,183.49],["use.",183.49,183.83]]},{"start":183.83,"end":187.29,"text":"Right. So how are you going to do this?","words":[["Right.",183.83,184.39],["So",185.03,185.51],["how",185.51,186.09],["are",186.09,186.23],["you",186.23,186.37],["going",186.37,186.61],["to",186.61,186.75],["do",186.75,186.91],["this?",186.91,187.29]]},{"start":187.73,"end":193.29,"text":"Well, I could make a checklist of sources of information for them to look at in advance,","words":[["Well,",187.73,188.23],["I",188.43,188.69],["could",188.69,188.99],["make",188.99,189.21],["a",189.21,189.47],["checklist",189.47,189.93],["of",189.93,190.35],["sources",190.35,190.79],["of",190.79,190.99],["information",190.99,191.49],["for",191.49,192.05],["them",192.05,192.19],["to",192.19,192.35],["look",192.35,192.53],["at",192.53,192.69],["in",192.69,192.83],["advance,",192.83,193.29]]},{"start":193.51,"end":196.81,"text":"so they could tick off the ones they actually use.","words":[["so",193.51,194.17],["they",194.17,194.35],["could",194.35,194.61],["tick",194.61,194.83],["off",194.83,195.01],["the",195.01,195.15],["ones",195.15,195.39],["they",195.39,195.71],["actually",195.71,196.35],["use.",196.35,196.81]]},{"start":197.67,"end":205.29,"text":"Things like farming magazines, farm product advertisements, television and the internet and so on.","words":[["Things",197.67,198.17],["like",198.17,198.59],["farming",198.59,199.39],["magazines,",199.39,199.95],["farm",200.75,201.19],["product",201.19,201.71],["advertisements,",201.71,202.41],["television",203.23,203.55],["and",203.55,203.99],["the",203.99,204.15],["internet",204.15,204.57],["and",204.57,204.89],["so",204.89,205.09],["on.",205.09,205.29]]},{"start":205.73,"end":210.37,"text":"It might be more useful to ask them rather than show them a list,","words":[["It",205.73,205.97],["might",205.97,206.17],["be",206.17,206.39],["more",206.39,206.55],["useful",206.55,206.97],["to",206.97,207.35],["ask",207.35,207.89],["them",207.89,208.25],["rather",208.25,208.77],["than",208.77,209.23],["show",209.23,209.57],["them",209.57,209.75],["a",209.75,209.89],["list,",209.89,210.37]]},{"start":210.37,"end":217.23,"text":"A spontaneous response to one or two open questions might give you a more accurate picture.","words":[["A",210.37,211.27],["spontaneous",211.27,211.95],["response",211.95,212.63],["to",212.63,213.11],["one",213.11,213.35],["or",213.35,213.47],["two",213.47,213.69],["open",213.69,214.09],["questions",214.09,214.55],["might",214.55,214.91],["give",214.91,215.25],["you",215.25,215.39],["a",215.39,215.57],["more",215.57,215.91],["accurate",215.91,216.63],["picture.",216.63,217.23]]},{"start":217.83,"end":219.35,"text":"Alright, I'll do that then.","words":[["Alright,",217.83,218.09],["I'll",218.57,218.85],["do",218.85,218.97],["that",218.97,219.17],["then.",219.17,219.35]]},{"start":219.95,"end":223.19,"text":"Now, talk me through some of the other issues you want to cover.","words":[["Now,",219.95,220.17],["talk",220.35,220.49],["me",220.49,220.67],["through",220.67,220.89],["some",220.89,221.19],["of",221.19,221.37],["the",221.37,221.49],["other",221.49,221.73],["issues",221.73,222.21],["you",222.21,222.61],["want",222.61,222.79],["to",222.79,222.93],["cover.",222.93,223.19]]},{"start":223.97,"end":228.05,"text":"Well, there's the way the government communicates with farmers.","words":[["Well,",223.97,224.41],["there's",224.65,225.07],["the",225.07,225.19],["way",225.19,225.41],["the",225.41,225.57],["government",225.57,226.15],["communicates",226.15,227.41],["with",227.41,227.69],["farmers.",227.69,228.05]]},{"start":228.35,"end":236.31,"text":"Right, well, one thing is, farmers complain that the government sends out the same information to all of them,","words":[["Right,",228.35,228.89],["well,",229.15,229.37],["one",230.11,230.47],["thing",230.47,230.79],["is,",230.79,231.11],["farmers",231.37,231.59],["complain",231.59,232.15],["that",232.15,232.47],["the",232.47,232.65],["government",232.65,232.95],["sends",232.95,233.47],["out",233.47,233.91],["the",233.91,234.21],["same",234.21,234.55],["information",234.55,235.17],["to",235.17,235.47],["all",235.47,235.85],["of",235.85,236.09],["them,",236.09,236.31]]},{"start":236.31,"end":241.07,"text":"whether they're poultry farmers or dairy farmers or arable farmers.","words":[["whether",236.31,236.91],["they're",236.91,237.31],["poultry",237.31,237.79],["farmers",237.79,238.21],["or",238.21,238.67],["dairy",238.67,238.93],["farmers",238.93,239.41],["or",239.41,239.77],["arable",239.77,240.41],["farmers.",240.41,241.07]]},{"start":241.57,"end":246.15,"text":"So they get all this information, but half of it doesn't actually apply to them.","words":[["So",241.57,241.73],["they",241.73,241.95],["get",241.95,242.17],["all",242.17,242.35],["this",242.35,242.49],["information,",242.49,243.15],["but",243.63,243.89],["half",243.89,244.21],["of",244.21,244.31],["it",244.31,244.43],["doesn't",244.43,244.73],["actually",244.73,245.15],["apply",245.15,245.69],["to",245.69,245.95],["them.",245.95,246.15]]},{"start":246.37,"end":249.65,"text":"Exactly. So you could look at that.","words":[["Exactly.",246.37,246.93],["So",247.47,248.19],["you",248.19,248.73],["could",248.73,248.99],["look",248.99,249.17],["at",249.17,249.35],["that.",249.35,249.65]]},{"start":250.05,"end":257.83,"text":"Right. Then I wanted to look at attitudes of British farmers to the cost of making any changes on their farms.","words":[["Right.",250.05,250.33],["Then",251.19,251.71],["I",251.71,252.03],["wanted",252.03,252.35],["to",252.35,252.57],["look",252.57,252.73],["at",252.73,252.87],["attitudes",252.87,253.39],["of",253.39,253.79],["British",253.79,254.19],["farmers",254.19,254.71],["to",254.71,255.07],["the",255.07,255.19],["cost",255.19,255.73],["of",255.73,256.17],["making",256.17,256.41],["any",256.41,256.65],["changes",256.65,257.07],["on",257.07,257.29],["their",257.29,257.47],["farms.",257.47,257.83]]},{"start":257.83,"end":265.23,"text":"accounts. According to articles I've read, farmers in Britain aren't in principle against","words":[["accounts.",257.83,257.95],["According",258.83,259.23],["to",259.23,259.57],["articles",259.57,260.21],["I've",260.21,260.75],["read,",260.75,261.05],["farmers",261.67,262.07],["in",262.07,262.33],["Britain",262.33,262.63],["aren't",262.63,263.27],["in",263.27,263.59],["principle",263.59,264.35],["against",264.35,265.23]]},{"start":265.23,"end":272.35,"text":"investing money in new machinery and new practices, but they're actually just too busy to work","words":[["investing",265.23,266.01],["money",266.01,266.53],["in",266.53,266.77],["new",266.77,267.01],["machinery",267.01,267.57],["and",267.57,267.95],["new",267.95,268.15],["practices,",268.15,268.67],["but",269.13,270.01],["they're",270.01,270.37],["actually",270.37,270.71],["just",270.71,271.05],["too",271.05,271.37],["busy",271.37,271.85],["to",271.85,272.11],["work",272.11,272.35]]},{"start":272.35,"end":274.53,"text":"out what the financial implications are.","words":[["out",272.35,272.61],["what",272.61,272.83],["the",272.83,273.01],["financial",273.01,273.45],["implications",273.45,273.85],["are.",273.85,274.53]]},{"start":274.85,"end":281.61,"text":"Yes, and a lot of them don't seem to consider getting financial advice from their accountants","words":[["Yes,",274.85,275.29],["and",275.91,276.31],["a",276.31,276.55],["lot",276.55,276.83],["of",276.83,277.01],["them",277.01,277.15],["don't",277.15,277.51],["seem",277.51,277.89],["to",277.89,278.09],["consider",278.09,278.57],["getting",278.57,278.97],["financial",278.97,279.69],["advice",279.69,280.23],["from",280.23,280.69],["their",280.69,280.91],["accountants",280.91,281.61]]},{"start":281.61,"end":282.43,"text":"about it either.","words":[["about",281.61,281.85],["it",281.85,282.09],["either.",282.09,282.43]]},{"start":282.73,"end":283.15,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",282.73,283.15]]},{"start":283.15,"end":287.91,"text":"There's also been some research in Australia on sheep rearing practices.","words":[["There's",283.15,283.77],["also",283.77,284.13],["been",284.13,284.41],["some",284.41,284.67],["research",284.67,285.17],["in",285.17,285.55],["Australia",285.55,286.01],["on",286.01,286.53],["sheep",286.53,286.91],["rearing",286.91,287.39],["practices.",287.39,287.91]]},{"start":288.96,"end":291.53,"text":"I can give you the reference if you like.","words":[["I",288.96,289.39],["can",289.39,289.83],["give",289.83,290.17],["you",290.17,290.35],["the",290.35,290.53],["reference",290.53,290.95],["if",290.95,291.23],["you",291.23,291.31],["like.",291.31,291.53]]},{"start":292.29,"end":298.81,"text":"Basically, it appears that the majority of Australian sheep farmers are willing to risk","words":[["Basically,",292.29,292.81],["it",293.07,293.13],["appears",293.13,293.47],["that",293.47,293.87],["the",293.87,294.17],["majority",294.17,294.69],["of",294.69,295.45],["Australian",295.45,296.19],["sheep",296.19,296.59],["farmers",296.59,297.03],["are",297.03,297.87],["willing",297.87,298.09],["to",298.09,298.37],["risk",298.37,298.81]]},{"start":298.81,"end":304.83,"text":"adopting new practices on the basis of just a few pieces of research.","words":[["adopting",298.81,299.45],["new",299.45,299.95],["practices",299.95,300.55],["on",300.55,301.53],["the",301.53,301.71],["basis",301.71,302.13],["of",302.13,302.59],["just",302.59,302.97],["a",302.97,303.51],["few",303.51,303.71],["pieces",303.71,304.09],["of",304.09,304.37],["research.",304.37,304.83]]},{"start":305.43,"end":311.21,"text":"They don't usually wait until the evidence in favour of the changes is overwhelming.","words":[["They",305.43,305.95],["don't",305.95,306.19],["usually",306.19,306.75],["wait",306.75,307.19],["until",307.19,307.79],["the",307.79,308.01],["evidence",308.01,308.45],["in",308.45,308.99],["favour",308.99,309.37],["of",309.37,309.77],["the",309.77,309.87],["changes",309.87,310.21],["is",310.21,310.59],["overwhelming.",310.59,311.21]]},{"start":311.21,"end":316.85,"text":"They're quite happy to act before then, so they can get ahead of the game.","words":[["They're",311.21,312.25],["quite",312.25,312.43],["happy",312.43,312.81],["to",312.81,313.01],["act",313.01,313.51],["before",313.51,314.25],["then,",314.25,314.69],["so",314.73,315.19],["they",315.19,315.41],["can",315.41,315.65],["get",315.65,316.01],["ahead",316.01,316.25],["of",316.25,316.37],["the",316.37,316.47],["game.",316.47,316.85]]},{"start":317.39,"end":320.47,"text":"OK, I'll take a look at that. Thanks.","words":[["OK,",317.39,317.79],["I'll",318.41,318.85],["take",318.85,319.11],["a",319.11,319.25],["look",319.25,319.35],["at",319.35,319.53],["that.",319.53,319.67],["Thanks.",320.19,320.47]]},{"start":324.09,"end":331.89,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 27 to 30 on page 6.","words":[["Before",324.09,324.37],["you",324.37,324.63],["hear",324.63,324.87],["the",324.87,325.01],["rest",325.01,325.31],["of",325.31,325.45],["the",325.45,325.53],["discussion,",325.53,326.05],["you",326.63,326.79],["have",326.79,326.99],["some",326.99,327.19],["time",327.19,327.55],["to",327.55,327.79],["look",327.79,327.95],["at",327.95,328.09],["questions",328.09,328.55],["27",328.55,329.59],["to",329.59,330.07],["30",330.07,330.51],["on",330.51,331.21],["page",331.21,331.45],["6.",331.45,331.89]]},{"start":352.26,"end":356.3,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 27 to 30.","words":[["Now",352.26,352.62],["listen",352.62,353.0],["and",353.0,353.48],["answer",353.48,353.76],["questions",353.76,354.22],["27",354.22,355.34],["to",355.34,355.82],["30.",355.82,356.3]]},{"start":359.98,"end":364.26,"text":"We said we'd also look at some of the reading material I've been reviewing.","words":[["We",359.98,360.42],["said",360.42,360.7],["we'd",360.7,361.04],["also",361.04,361.44],["look",361.44,361.76],["at",361.76,361.96],["some",361.96,362.2],["of",362.2,362.36],["the",362.36,362.5],["reading",362.5,362.78],["material",362.78,363.34],["I've",363.34,363.72],["been",363.72,363.9],["reviewing.",363.9,364.26]]},{"start":364.26,"end":371.52,"text":"Yes. I had another look at contemporary farming manual, which is clearly bang up to date.","words":[["Yes.",364.26,365.02],["I",365.48,365.68],["had",365.68,365.94],["another",365.94,366.22],["look",366.22,366.56],["at",366.56,366.9],["contemporary",366.9,367.8],["farming",367.8,368.4],["manual,",368.4,368.94],["which",369.24,369.76],["is",369.76,369.94],["clearly",369.94,370.36],["bang",370.36,370.9],["up",370.9,371.08],["to",371.08,371.24],["date.",371.24,371.52]]},{"start":372.14,"end":377.0,"text":"It covers a lot of things a farmer might want to know, but it's so dull.","words":[["It",372.14,372.26],["covers",372.26,372.56],["a",372.56,372.76],["lot",372.76,373.06],["of",373.06,373.26],["things",373.26,373.58],["a",373.58,373.82],["farmer",373.82,374.08],["might",374.08,374.48],["want",374.48,374.88],["to",374.88,375.16],["know,",375.16,375.42],["but",375.48,375.68],["it's",375.68,376.58],["so",376.58,376.78],["dull.",376.78,377.0]]},{"start":377.44,"end":383.96,"text":"Absolutely. I found it really hard going. And I can't imagine any farmer waiting through it.","words":[["Absolutely.",377.44,377.9],["I",378.94,379.16],["found",379.16,379.38],["it",379.38,379.52],["really",379.52,379.98],["hard",379.98,380.34],["going.",380.34,380.7],["And",381.48,381.66],["I",381.66,381.78],["can't",381.78,381.94],["imagine",381.94,382.26],["any",382.26,382.5],["farmer",382.5,383.02],["waiting",383.02,383.38],["through",383.38,383.72],["it.",383.72,383.96]]},{"start":384.58,"end":386.38,"text":"There aren't even any decent pictures.","words":[["There",384.58,385.12],["aren't",385.12,385.28],["even",385.28,385.44],["any",385.44,385.64],["decent",385.64,385.96],["pictures.",385.96,386.38]]},{"start":386.88,"end":389.98,"text":"Did you have time to look at running a small farm?","words":[["Did",386.88,387.12],["you",387.12,387.26],["have",387.26,387.4],["time",387.4,387.68],["to",387.68,387.84],["look",387.84,388.0],["at",388.0,388.2],["running",388.2,388.96],["a",388.96,389.3],["small",389.3,389.52],["farm?",389.52,389.98]]},{"start":389.98,"end":396.66,"text":"Yes, although I only read bits of it because, despite being entertaining, it wasn't very","words":[["Yes,",389.98,390.74],["although",391.18,391.48],["I",391.48,391.74],["only",391.74,391.9],["read",391.9,392.12],["bits",392.12,392.5],["of",392.5,392.68],["it",392.68,392.8],["because,",392.8,393.12],["despite",393.68,394.08],["being",394.08,394.46],["entertaining,",394.46,395.22],["it",396.02,396.12],["wasn't",396.12,396.4],["very",396.4,396.66]]},{"start":396.66,"end":397.18,"text":"academic.","words":[["academic.",396.66,397.18]]},{"start":397.82,"end":404.6,"text":"I know. And a lot of the information is either misleading or simply wrong. I'm surprised","words":[["I",397.82,398.04],["know.",398.04,398.4],["And",399.18,399.6],["a",399.6,399.76],["lot",399.76,399.9],["of",399.9,400.06],["the",400.06,400.2],["information",400.2,400.7],["is",400.7,401.0],["either",401.0,401.3],["misleading",401.3,401.74],["or",401.74,402.2],["simply",402.2,402.56],["wrong.",402.56,403.04],["I'm",403.8,404.26],["surprised",404.26,404.6]]},{"start":404.6,"end":409.78,"text":"it got published at all. I don't imagine the farming press will rate it very highly.","words":[["it",404.6,404.82],["got",404.82,404.96],["published",404.96,405.3],["at",405.3,405.58],["all.",405.58,405.9],["I",406.66,406.86],["don't",406.86,407.08],["imagine",407.08,407.46],["the",407.46,407.74],["farming",407.74,408.16],["press",408.16,408.6],["will",408.6,408.8],["rate",408.8,409.04],["it",409.04,409.2],["very",409.2,409.36],["highly.",409.36,409.78]]},{"start":411.26,"end":418.5,"text":"You recommend agriculture and economics. I expected that it would be really difficult.","words":[["You",411.26,411.98],["recommend",411.98,412.52],["agriculture",412.52,413.3],["and",413.3,414.16],["economics.",414.16,414.88],["I",415.6,416.32],["expected",416.32,416.88],["that",416.88,417.34],["it",417.34,417.44],["would",417.44,417.56],["be",417.56,417.74],["really",417.74,418.1],["difficult.",418.1,418.5]]},{"start":418.5,"end":424.66,"text":"The title's a bit off-putting, but I thought it was brilliant, so I've bought it.","words":[["The",418.5,419.34],["title's",419.34,419.92],["a",419.92,420.06],["bit",420.06,420.36],["off",420.36,420.5],["-putting,",420.5,420.88],["but",421.18,421.8],["I",421.8,422.1],["thought",422.1,422.28],["it",422.28,422.4],["was",422.4,422.52],["brilliant,",422.52,422.98],["so",423.58,423.88],["I've",423.88,424.28],["bought",424.28,424.46],["it.",424.46,424.66]]},{"start":424.92,"end":425.28,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",424.92,425.28]]},{"start":426.0,"end":431.42,"text":"Some people think it relies too heavily on farming practices in specific parts of the","words":[["Some",426.0,426.34],["people",426.34,426.54],["think",426.54,426.8],["it",426.8,427.0],["relies",427.0,427.36],["too",427.36,427.86],["heavily",427.86,428.18],["on",428.18,428.5],["farming",428.5,428.94],["practices",428.94,429.58],["in",429.58,430.22],["specific",430.22,430.66],["parts",430.66,431.12],["of",431.12,431.32],["the",431.32,431.42]]},{"start":431.42,"end":438.72,"text":"world, but the theories that underpin these are universal, and that's why it's a required","words":[["world,",431.42,431.78],["but",432.14,432.62],["the",432.62,432.76],["theories",432.76,433.24],["that",433.24,433.82],["underpin",433.82,434.48],["these",434.48,434.8],["are",434.8,435.34],["universal,",435.34,436.18],["and",436.72,437.16],["that's",437.16,437.62],["why",437.62,437.92],["it's",437.92,438.24],["a",438.24,438.34],["required",438.34,438.72]]},{"start":438.72,"end":441.44,"text":"textbook for anyone studying agriculture.","words":[["textbook",438.72,439.3],["for",439.3,439.58],["anyone",439.58,440.04],["studying",440.04,440.78],["agriculture.",440.78,441.44]]},{"start":441.94,"end":442.24,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",441.94,442.24]]},{"start":442.94,"end":444.72,"text":"What else did you come across?","words":[["What",442.94,443.3],["else",443.3,443.58],["did",443.58,443.96],["you",443.96,444.18],["come",444.18,444.42],["across?",444.42,444.72]]},{"start":445.36,"end":451.38,"text":"I borrowed how to survive in farming from the library. I thought it would be interesting","words":[["I",445.36,445.96],["borrowed",445.96,446.36],["how",446.36,446.9],["to",446.9,447.06],["survive",447.06,447.52],["in",447.52,447.78],["farming",447.78,448.18],["from",448.18,448.58],["the",448.58,448.78],["library.",448.78,449.1],["I",449.8,450.32],["thought",450.32,450.52],["it",450.52,450.66],["would",450.66,450.78],["be",450.78,450.9],["interesting",450.9,451.38]]},{"start":451.38,"end":457.24,"text":"background and I liked the informal style, but it turned out to have been written years","words":[["background",451.38,451.9],["and",451.9,452.52],["I",452.52,452.96],["liked",452.96,453.24],["the",453.24,453.46],["informal",453.46,453.9],["style,",453.9,454.46],["but",454.98,455.52],["it",455.52,455.68],["turned",455.68,455.9],["out",455.9,456.14],["to",456.14,456.34],["have",456.34,456.46],["been",456.46,456.64],["written",456.64,456.9],["years",456.9,457.24]]},{"start":457.24,"end":461.4,"text":"ago. Yes, and like everything else, farming fashions","words":[["ago.",457.24,457.56],["Yes,",457.8,458.12],["and",458.48,458.72],["like",458.72,459.14],["everything",459.14,459.8],["else,",459.8,460.1],["farming",460.36,460.58],["fashions",460.58,461.4]]},{"start":461.4,"end":465.08,"text":"have changed, so it's badly in need of a new edition.","words":[["have",461.4,461.62],["changed,",461.62,462.14],["so",462.14,462.86],["it's",462.86,463.14],["badly",463.14,463.56],["in",463.56,463.82],["need",463.82,464.1],["of",464.1,464.22],["a",464.22,464.32],["new",464.32,464.62],["edition.",464.62,465.08]]},{"start":465.9,"end":477.9,"text":"Can I ask you a question about... That is the end of section three. You","words":[["Can",465.9,466.5],["I",466.5,466.66],["ask",466.66,466.88],["you",466.88,467.0],["a",467.0,467.1],["question",467.1,467.52],["about...",467.52,468.56],["That",471.76,472.18],["is",472.18,472.36],["the",472.36,472.54],["end",472.54,472.78],["of",472.78,472.98],["section",472.98,473.28],["three.",473.28,473.78],["You",477.84,477.9]]},{"start":507.66,"end":510.98,"text":"Now turn to section 4 on page 7.","words":[["Now",507.66,508.52],["turn",508.52,508.82],["to",508.82,509.02],["section",509.02,509.3],["4",509.3,509.8],["on",509.8,510.34],["page",510.34,510.58],["7.",510.58,510.98]]}]}